Dialogue: 0,0:23:09.52,0:23:23.70,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3\bord3\3c&H6C766D&\1a&HFF&}但這夢幻的時光確實存在
Dialogue: 0,0:23:24.11,0:23:31.03,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3\bord3\3c&H6C766D&\1a&HFF&}僅僅因為我們能互相道別
Dialogue: 0,0:23:31.30,0:23:41.18,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3\bord3\3c&H6C766D&\1a&HFF&}我便能感覺到是那般幸福
Dialogue: 0,0:23:41.80,0:23:45.60,ED_CN,,0,0,0,,{\fad(240,240)\blur3\bord3\3c&H6C766D&\1a&HFF&}懷抱著感激感受你的溫暖
